<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333">
    Dear <%= name %>,
  </p>
  <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333">
    We detected multiple failed sign-in attempts on your account and have temporarily locked it for your protection.
  </p>
  <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333">
    Your account will be automatically unlocked after a short period. If you did not attempt to sign in, please contact our support team immediately at
    <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.
  </p>
  <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333">
    For your security, we recommend:
  </p>
  <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li style="color: #555555">Changing your password if you suspect unauthorized access</li>
    <li style="color: #555555">Enabling two-factor authentication when available</li>
    <li style="color: #555555">Reviewing your recent account activity</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333">
    If this was you and you need immediate access, please contact support.
  </p>
  <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333333">
    Thanks!<br /> Meridian Security Team
  </p>
